   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Revealed to the little ones",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is your pleasure",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Come to me all you who are weary and burdened",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I will give you rest",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Take my yoke upon you and learn from me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For I am gentle and humble in heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
